Outputs the current '''day of the month''' in Japan Standard Time (JST, UTC+9), via [[Module:JST]]. Use instead of <code><nowiki>{{CURRENTDAY}}</nowiki></code> when a date must follow Japan's local time rather than the wiki server clock. Takes no parameters.

==Syntax==
{{T|CURRENTJSTDAY}}

==Examples==
{{T|CURRENTJSTDAY|_Y_=1}}

==See also==
Part of the JST date family, all backed by [[Module:JST]]:
* {{T|CURRENTJSTYEAR}} — current year (JST)
* {{T|CURRENTJSTMONTH}} — current month (JST)
* {{T|CURRENTJSTDAY}} — current day of the month (JST)